'''Boraphim''' (イノエンジェル, ''Inoenjeru'', '''Inoangel''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Bore]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]].

